      "instance_name": "man_standing_in_front_of_wagon",
      "label": "man standing in front of wagon",
      "description": "A man dressed in cowboy attire stands with arms crossed in front of a large wooden wagon with large spoked wheels. The scene is set outdoors in a rural or junkyard-like environment with dry grass and scattered tires. The man is the central visual focus, positioned directly in front of the wagon, which occupies the background. The text 'long time no see' is overlaid at the top of the image and 'nigger' at the bottom, framing the visual scene with hateful context.",
